寒々 寒々… 夜の帳凍る言葉
Cold, so cold... Night's curtain, freezing words,

3
00:03:55,150 --> 00:03:58,500
受け流して流れ星を待っていた
letting them pass as I waited for a shooting star.

4
00:03:58,500 --> 00:04:01,800
光には遠い心で それでも
With a heart far from the light, even so,

5
00:04:02,100 --> 00:04:05,800
輝きへと手を伸ばしたい
I want to reach out toward the radiance.

6
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:08,000
それに負うは 暴れる夢が痛い
For that, the raging dream hurts.

7
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:11,200
今は今は名も無き花
Right now, right now, a nameless flower.

8
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:15,000
以前の蕾だと 此の世の嵐を耐えながら描くよ
As a former bud, I'll paint while enduring the storm.

9
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:18,500
情熱は絶やさぬままで
Keeping my passion unquenched.

10
00:04:18,500 --> 00:04:22,000
泣きそうなときは 泣いてしまえ
When you feel like crying, go ahead and cry.

11
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:26,000
それが 未来開花 魁となれ
That is the future blooming, becoming the pioneer.

12
00:04:26,100 --> 00:04:31,000
瞳の純度は上がる事になるから
Because the purity of your eyes will rise.

13
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:35,000
泣きそうなときは泣いてしまえ
When you feel like crying, go ahead and cry.

14
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,200
日はそんなこともあると笑って
Laughing that days like that happen too.

15
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:41,000
涙と混ざり、希望よ
Mixing with tears, oh hope.

16
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:46,500
そんな感じ? 華麗に咲き誇る 前哨戦
Something like that? A preliminary battle blooming brilliantly.

17
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:50,500
花、さながら虎視眈々 仁、しかし梅香々々
Flowers, like koshitantan; benevolence, yet plum blossoms fragrant.

18
00:04:50,500 --> 00:04:53,900
業、焦らず 雲、狙わず
Karma, not rushing; clouds, not aiming.

19
00:05:07,418 --> 00:05:10,058
ねぇ、羽ばたいた心は
Hey, did my fluttering heart

20
00:05:10,058 --> 00:05:12,458
今でも迷わずずっと飛べてるかな？
still fly straight without hesitation?

21
00:05:12,458 --> 00:05:14,908
ねぇ、本当はやってみたいこと
Hey, the things I really want to do,

22
00:05:14,908 --> 00:05:17,328
まだまだ隠し続けているでしょう？
I'm still keeping them hidden, aren't I?

23
00:05:17,428 --> 00:05:19,458
悲しませないように
So as not to make you sad,

24
00:05:19,458 --> 00:05:21,208
心配させないように
so as not to worry you,

25
00:05:21,208 --> 00:05:25,258
数えきれない嘘をついて君の前で笑っていた
I told countless lies and smiled before you.

26
00:05:25,408 --> 00:05:28,108
大切なものちゃんと守るために
To properly protect what's precious,

27
00:05:28,108 --> 00:05:30,658
それはきっと間違いじゃないさ
surely that isn't a mistake.

28
00:05:30,758 --> 00:05:32,458
これでは、いいのかな…？
Is this really okay...?

29
00:05:32,558 --> 00:05:35,008
正しさは感情の後だった
Righteousness followed my emotions.

30
00:05:35,008 --> 00:05:37,758
想いのない生き様になんて興味はないよ
I have no interest in a life without feelings.

31
