come on, open your heart.

407
00:37:33,092 --> 00:37:35,892
わからないふりをして 寝ぼけてるのか?
Are you playing dumb, still half asleep?

408
00:37:35,892 --> 00:37:38,322
もっと熱い暗闇を見せて?ね?
Show me even hotter darkness, won't you?

409
00:37:39,592 --> 00:37:41,292
さりげない合図に隠された
Hidden within a casual signal,

410
00:37:41,292 --> 00:37:43,862
答えはすぐにわからせてあげる
I'll make you understand the answer right away.

411
00:37:43,862 --> 00:37:46,292
微笑な嘘にまみれた
Smeared in smiling lies,

412
00:37:46,292 --> 00:37:49,342
拒んだままに 受け止めてあげる
just as you refused, I'll accept you.

413
00:37:52,052 --> 00:37:56,192
常世の闇に刻むこの名を わからせてあげる
Engraving this name into the eternal darkness, I'll make you understand.

414
00:37:56,192 --> 00:37:58,332
ほら悲鳴を聞かせてよ
Come on, let me hear your screams!

415
00:38:01,952 --> 00:38:04,372
夢見ないで
Don't dream,

416
00:38:04,372 --> 00:38:06,082
ほら聞かせて
come on, let me hear it.

